# AProf local scratch space and benchmark runtime artifacts.
**/tmp/*

scaffolding/benchmarks/aprof_benchmark/**/build/
scaffolding/benchmarks/aprof_benchmark/**/build_sim/
scaffolding/benchmarks/aprof_benchmark/**/data/
scaffolding/benchmarks/aprof_benchmark/**/output/
scaffolding/benchmarks/aprof_benchmark/**/msprof_sim_output/
